Package: echo-recon
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Echo Recon Contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-flask, python3-venv, git, ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/mdnhbn/echo-recon-workspace
Description: local Echo Recon assessment dashboard
 A local-only dashboard for authorized, scoped security assessments. The
 package installs the dashboard; its optional scanner backends remain in the
 normal user's home folder.
